{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "c6df628480030025424a8d154f296059c7ee986071e4c7965ec22625d4f73f5d",
  "bundle_request_count": 12,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:31e113abf68c0209596257d8e67968180aaec16d0913a7db4c7981f272deb1da",
      "request_id": "31e113abf68c0209596257d8e67968180aaec16d0913a7db4c7981f272deb1da",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "50ffc548776d9397f81dc0bfa578ed30",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+22%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那他有没有抢走本土球员的机会？这次要分清两类名额。本届巴塞尔有三张常规外卡，规则另设一张有条件的额外外卡，给赛事指定的A加球员。瑞士媒体对这次参赛的报道，明确将德约这张卡列为A加外卡。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "19ae7619bd0c0517432ad76bc2ba1167ee99018e6c3860629aaf50833ad2fe2d",
      "words_sha256": "13fabf917733f2fd216103679d326637a57f3185a8bd1e7f16d4e2c42c23f9b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3589e455dce728432c8212029135c0deff2c0ca9b23e0e347a37ddaa99ba1499",
      "request_id": "3589e455dce728432c8212029135c0deff2c0ca9b23e0e347a37ddaa99ba1499",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "43c3d19ed4b580d1aff62c551c687fc7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+22%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "ATP规则明确，球员须在期限内完成正式报名，才能进入这条按排名录取和递补的队列。即使后来有人退赛，也要先从合资格的报名球员里递补。高排名，并不意味着可以在开赛前随时插入这条队列。于是问题变成了：德约为什么这么晚才决定来？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7697a958abc6481b61a6027e34f688a49b4820571c077b799fb2de50b68e5754",
      "words_sha256": "a2bfe240f219b046ff826c20bf108188ee6e1127946d13d50c055f13c0bd988c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:387d69f86cce532c5710daff807e6c20b8dfa38d669d876f066da46b7d926783",
      "request_id": "387d69f86cce532c5710daff807e6c20b8dfa38d669d876f066da46b7d926783",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "33cdd167e2d879ba38f085c9c5614b40",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+22%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这张额外外卡，也不是赛事随时能送给任何人的第四张卡。球员要符合指定条件，并且最晚在赛事周之前的周五、美国东部时间上午十点报出名字。若没有用掉，席位交给录取名单里下一位合资格球员。因此，本土三张卡没少，不等于这个额外名额对其他球员的入围机会毫无影响。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "41e0916960538b1b48a39c5ccbba5d573792f75a9e961c6c899f11b771f6824c",
      "words_sha256": "8302445496375ecf3c1043fa1f5f7fdc1a6560be29bae721412e20c8e0d5a82d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:390762f12c005afd2126f22529bd48c22a93b247c2ed35bbe6b923110c4fb401",
      "request_id": "390762f12c005afd2126f22529bd48c22a93b247c2ed35bbe6b923110c4fb401",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a77078c126feb7820b38b1eb646c773d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+22%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "时间控出来，是他能够来；争取年终总决赛资格，是这次加赛的竞技意义。赛事和德约自己的官网都提到，他需要积分，争取都灵席位。二零一一年之后，他隔了十五年，再次来到巴塞尔。把他带回来的，是赛季末仍然要争的一张门票。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4d519267af0a13244ffd3a4f0e1d0d4a67e54a560a9554b8e1216f82974dd644",
      "words_sha256": "c1617ee1d5b4bc8eceec9c5bd65f7f73e3b0e47acdae26c0cde886707864b4dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3a491b749c21aadb072685af91fa1e91d47f814c14ca9a4ac83c5488651e1669",
      "request_id": "3a491b749c21aadb072685af91fa1e91d47f814c14ca9a4ac83c5488651e1669",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e45a67e8939e03e0e68de564169ee882",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+22%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "现在回到开头：为什么外卡和四号种子能同时出现？外卡记录的是参赛渠道，种子依据的是排种子时适用的最新ATP排名。规则明确允许外卡球员成为种子。进入正赛之后，德约按排名取得四号种子的位置，两种身份各管一件事，完全可以同时成立。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f717edd3f0b561efe0706f81279ae242effd2f65740eaaa88bb2efeb15ffb065",
      "words_sha256": "b635e9e08964438808b9413bde335cc6e992939d91c5a376b32e389e40e6d416"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:467466682c806c38eef3dff13fd703b3fcc8fec9669477cd127f22f0191db5b6",
      "request_id": "467466682c806c38eef3dff13fd703b3fcc8fec9669477cd127f22f0191db5b6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "08a3a8e44a823377b4584c3c361b0f4a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+22%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "德约科维奇参加二零二六年巴塞尔站，用的是外卡，却又是四号种子。排名够，为什么还要一张邀请？关键在于，能排进名单，和已经报了名，是两回事。更特别的是，他拿的这张卡，还没有占掉给瑞士球员的三张常规外卡。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "38010c61c3b13ae931a3f4403b0c4495fe82bffc70bafc0a6023f1c5a2322fa8",
      "words_sha256": "89a644d8af98b9006950f4e84523a0c642086100c6dc988893a54d22ae6ec8ee"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6353c27815a63f2fa39756d9a255d1e99e94ac514cfde014340b11e21d1029ba",
      "request_id": "6353c27815a63f2fa39756d9a255d1e99e94ac514cfde014340b11e21d1029ba",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "24c7ccea8daebc9e26619effead0723a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+22%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "德约排名够，为什么还要外卡？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "83dccba60e631dab3645148e8e43e213b5fc63da20bce188362f05fe40658a8c",
      "words_sha256": "5639845abdbd1e11e51d01a553d353f088c424aabf44dc00f4a9f8f280522c3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:71a0e485337e67ffe4845bf0ed263805ee9ab0b33286c29bf363d000e6157fb3",
      "request_id": "71a0e485337e67ffe4845bf0ed263805ee9ab0b33286c29bf363d000e6157fb3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "de84075b6954c516f36027c0b895f796",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+22%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "所以，德约这次需要外卡，解决的是常规报名之后临时加入的问题。外卡不只帮助排名不足的新人，也能让临时调整日程的高排名球员参赛。看懂一张签表，要把排名、报名、外卡和种子分开看。你更支持把额外名额留给临时参赛的名将，还是交给下一位报名球员？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3d9c58b607010979c8612367dea98e1a30032f6d6733033fe5bef639c2155de8",
      "words_sha256": "8036768615c0eace2935538a2ff08f4f1c061e7cdd10a51b147ef0fb5ef09dc0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:7ed08dff75b4ae59bb83d32c9ccbad10f5450a62029310651492146b06c0abbd",
      "request_id": "7ed08dff75b4ae59bb83d32c9ccbad10f5450a62029310651492146b06c0abbd",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "dc5e348b3bcada811dedb5d9f0a129ce",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+22%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这次临时参赛，有具体的日程背景。十月十四日，六王大满贯表演赛宣布推迟到十二月。瑞士媒体采访巴塞尔赛事总监后报道，德约原本计划参加那场表演赛，空档出现后，双方在两天内达成了巴塞尔参赛协议。十月十六日，赛事官宣他回归。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1c0243abfef234b80c3a87d7a69a170fd7b739f91ea563dfe8e3d3c485b767c6",
      "words_sha256": "c05b1439d3948534bc26c3d5175724accf67de352ff7c41abc668525fa309cb8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8a56c4c5ee65e2f35b7bd21756678f33f6ae2c69704c61a9611c3f9ea79b93b4",
      "request_id": "8a56c4c5ee65e2f35b7bd21756678f33f6ae2c69704c61a9611c3f9ea79b93b4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "00127ecb14a99c69cb068cf6003258c5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+22%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先看报名的时钟。巴塞尔属于ATP五百赛，常规单打正赛报名在赛事周周一之前二十八天截止。正赛十月二十六日开始，按通则推算，截止节点是九月二十八日，美国东部时间中午十二点。这里适用的是四周，不能照搬大满贯常见的六周。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b4fa50a5762bce0793ce92956f15d794648d2dcebcca295e8785ba821454eeb0",
      "words_sha256": "f6406275f1dd195448978c017307992b40da2b03c37d9a6a74c7cd9f4a12f5a4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8a85769f7307141b24f323d51d2951d37da2bbe663f76aaedd808d7398ff03ae",
      "request_id": "8a85769f7307141b24f323d51d2951d37da2bbe663f76aaedd808d7398ff03ae",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "21c116462b43a1e6dc2e6a94c7d5a869",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+22%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "看本届实际名单，就更清楚了。赛事十月十九日公告，三名正赛外卡球员是瓦林卡、基姆和施特里克。德约用的是额外通道，没有挤掉这三张。不过，额外外卡仍在原有签表名额之内，不会让三十二人的签表突然变成三十三人。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2fee243d4b28f3cf1986db7984884a75ca8c289ba1afb8f82ab4c89f006aa296",
      "words_sha256": "3d23c0241b282f455c6ddc53c96518dfc5719faa1866085700751b05e70b785a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:df16a1677257215768694c833890c06b5c5f7d0289d7f47db16a73344075ebb5",
      "request_id": "df16a1677257215768694c833890c06b5c5f7d0289d7f47db16a73344075ebb5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c7c0df02cee89d9ddaf9e2b7e58c8af5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+22%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同一周，阿尔卡拉斯参加维也纳，也是外卡，却列二号种子。维也纳赛事官方说明，六王表演赛延期后，总监联系他的团队，双方很快敲定参赛。所以，顶尖球员拿外卡，不一定是排名不够，也可能是常规报名早已截止后，临时调整了赛程。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "60f5cf97930ce9f85f34710abc88f545172af416e28ac559828bbdf302edcd36",
      "words_sha256": "d5c1c25f5b730998beda753432d57b5be352b4419eeb7ba61e002d51aa2d9d56"
    },
